OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FRather cloudy with the chance
OL,6,Fof a few showers, these mainly over
OL,7,Fthe hills. Becoming generally drier
OL,8,Fthrough the afternoon with brighter
OL,9,Fspells. Light or moderate east or
OL,10,Fsoutheast winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FMainly dry and cloudy, the
OL,13,Fbest of any breaks through Moray. A
OL,14,Flittle drizzle possible over the hills
OL,15,Fand winds remaining light.
OL,16,
OL,17,CWednesday:FMainly dry and cloudy or
OL,18,Fbright with occasional sunny breaks,
OL,19,Fthe best of these through Moray. Winds
OL,20,Fwill be moderate from the east.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
